.PHONY: verify <<verify-targets>>

## verify: run every app's gate
verify: <<verify-targets: e.g. verify-api verify-web>>

<!-- EXAMPLE (Acme Notes) — xoá sau khi điền -->
## verify-api: typecheck + test + build (apps/api)
verify-api:
	npm --workspace apps/api run typecheck
	npm --workspace apps/api run test
	npm --workspace apps/api run build

## verify-web: typecheck + test + build (apps/web)
verify-web:
	npm --workspace apps/web run typecheck
	npm --workspace apps/web run test
	npm --workspace apps/web run build
<!-- /EXAMPLE -->

